{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomaly vehicles are back \u2014 and they\u2019re more furious than ever! New areas have emerged that must be shut down, but one experiment won\u2019t be enough this time. Each zone features a variety of experiment types and objectives to complete. You\u2019ll have the freedom to choose how you approach each challenge \u2014 from your starting items and vehicles to your upgrades, modifications, and more. Time to get to work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enter multiple locations exploring vast areas and surviving through experiments.<br>- Investigate and discover anomalies to properly handle cases.<br>- Manage your experiments with provided resources, such as vehicles, items, modifications and more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646210?t=1759005512","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646210?t=1759005512","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646210/cc6548bdbde4c0f12ddfd58246e9debb5d3b92e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759005512","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646210/cc6548bdbde4c0f12ddfd58246e9debb5d3b92e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759005512","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3931830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomaly vehicles are back \u2014 and they\u2019re more furious than ever! New areas have emerged that must be shut down, but one exp